BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:💬 Discussion 0: Me in 30 Seconds [REL C 225-029]
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260912
DTSTAMP:20260811T204100Z
UID:event-assignment-1418859
SEQUENCE:0
CLASS:PUBLIC
DESCRIPTION:--------------------------\nEstimated time: 30 minutes\n------
 --------------------\n\nI want to get to know you a bit as the amazing son
  or daughter of God that you are\, and so do your online classmates! Your 
 assignment is to create a quick video of yourself describing you in about 
 thirty seconds or so. For example\, tell me about where you are from\, if/
 where you served a mission\, your academic major\, if you're married or ha
 ve kids\, what BYU teams/groups you are involved with\, the mad skills or 
 hobbies you have\, etc. Be as creative and loose as you want to (in fact\,
  the less stuffy the better). You can either take the video using your sma
 rtphone and upload it here\, or you can use the video feature on this disc
 ussion board to film directly from your computer’s webcam.\n\nAfter you 
 have posted your video (2 points)\, watch three other people’s videos fr
 om class and respond to their videos by commenting on something you find i
 nteresting about them (1 point each).
URL;VALUE=URI:https://byu.instructure.com/calendar?include_contexts=course
 _37977&month=09&year=2026#assignment_1418859
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://instruct
 ure-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/account_74070000000000001/attachments/8409020
 /dp_app.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://instructure-uploads.s3.a
 mazonaws.com/account_74070000000000001/attachments/8073295/canvas-byuonlin
 e-app.css"><h2><span style="font-size: 12pt\;"><i>Estimated time: 30 minut
 es</i></span></h2>\n<hr style="height: 4px\; background-color: #002e5d\; c
 olor: #002e5d\;">\n<p>I want to get to know you a bit as the amazing son o
 r daughter of God that you are\, and so do your online classmates! Your as
 signment is to create a quick video of yourself describing you in about th
 irty seconds or so. For example\, tell me about where you are from\, if/wh
 ere you served a mission\, your academic major\, if you're married or have
  kids\, what BYU teams/groups you are involved with\, the mad skills or ho
 bbies you have\, etc. Be as creative and loose as you want to (in fact\, t
 he less stuffy the better). You can either take the video using your smart
 phone and upload it here\, or you can use the video feature on this discus
 sion board to film directly from your computer’s webcam.</p>\n<p>After y
 ou have posted your video (2 points)\, watch three other people’s videos
  from class and respond to their videos by commenting on something you fin
 d interesting about them (1 point each).</p>\n<hr style="height: 4px\; bac
 kground-color: #002e5d\; color: #002e5d\;"><script src="https://instructur
 e-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/account_74070000000000001/attachments/8409019/d
 p_app.js"></script>
END:VEVENT
